WEBVTT

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.570
Are you okay, President Aria?

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:45.660
It looks like you're having a hard time making friends with the birds.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:50.660
Don't let this get you down.

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.340
Miracles come to those who believe.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:57.670
I need to work hard and become a Prima Undine, too.

00:01:57.670 --> 00:01:59.340
Better get practicing!

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:02.510
Looks like someone's fired up.

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:07.690
Absolutely! Getting promoted to Single has worked wonders for my motivation.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.280
So, let's get going on today's practice.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.100
Thank you for doing this with me.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.520
Mm-hmm.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:27.310
This is Aqua, the planet of water, in the city of Neo-Venezia.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:34.550
This city is a relocation and reconstruction of the original Venice, which was once on Manhome.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:44.120
The old and the new mingle together, time flows nice and slowly, and mysteries abound for those who look for them.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:55.100
It's our job as Undines to be gondoliers and tour guides.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:03:04.050
At the Aria Company, I, Akari Mizunashi,
and my apprentice Ai, give tours to the people.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:08.150
Let's go on a wonderful journey together.

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:26.990
The gentle wind strokes my cheek

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:36.230
I sway among the sound of waves

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:45.720
And I can feel my whole body relax

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:56.770
I close my eyes, and then I can see...

00:03:56.770 --> 00:04:04.650
...the path that the wind takes

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:09.160
Come, let's paddle away

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:14.940
To the shining waves

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:23.900
Soon we'll be overflowing with smiles

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:28.600
Come, let's let others feel

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:34.230
This excitement in our hearts

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:43.100
I'll ride the wind to where you are

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:49.270
I'm on my way, Undine

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.740
For That Person I Wish to Meet...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.240
It's been so long since we've seen them!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:15.170
Alice and Aika have been so busy ever since they became Prima Undines.

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:16.870
Look, a kitty!

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:24.470
That chance meeting must have been a miracle from Aqua!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.530
A miracle...

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:34.120
Back when Alicia was still on active duty,

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.730
she was swamped with work every day.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.320
Wow, look at this schedule.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:45.600
Alicia won't get any time off at this rate.

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:53.200
I need to learn the ropes so I can be useful, too!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.430
Hello, Akira...

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:07.340
Did you need anything?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.050
No, I was just passing by.

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:13.890
Did you want to see Alicia?

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.130
A present...

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:19.560
Oh, right, today is...

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.980
Alicia's half-birthday.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:28.600
I totally forgot.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:32.240
Well, you <i>are</i> from Manhome. Don't worry about it.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:39.710
Aqua's years are 24 months long,
so you celebrate two birthdays a year.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.920
Yep. We call the in-between one a half-birthday.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:53.230
Alicia's birthday is 10/30 and today's 22/30, so today is Alicia's half-birthday.

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:57.270
So you brought a present for her.

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:04.360
N-no, I just got half the day off for once, and I figured she'd be bellyaching about her workload,

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.410
and I wanted to tease her about it, and...

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:14.340
She's with her last customer for the day right now,

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.490
so she'll be free until the six o'clock meeting at the Gondola Association.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.670
Really? Thanks.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:27.710
Athena was supposed to come too, but she got a job at the last minute.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:29.340
I see.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:31.480
I'll get it!

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:38.370
Hello, thank you for calling the Aria Company.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.620
Akari?

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:41.560
Alicia!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:48.010
I'm sorry, but it turns out I have to give a tour to some guests from the Gondola Association.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.110
Oh.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:54.220
The meeting will go until late at night,
so I'll go straight home from there, okay?

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.840
I have to go. I'm keeping the customers waiting.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:07:59.740
Okay.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.210
Akira...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:12.320
Well, I've got a workshop tonight, so I should get going.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:16.300
I'll leave the present here, so can you give it to her tomorrow?

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:21.430
Akira!

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:26.200
I'd like to go training now.

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.980
Would you come with me?

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.570
Training? On your own time?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.280
Yes! Specifically, Alicia's course!

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:42.370
I won't go easy on you, got it?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.290
Yes! Thank you!

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:31.460
Thanks, Akari. Let's go back now.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.430
Okay.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:42.100
To be honest, I didn't really come over today to give her a present.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:48.190
We struggled together ever since we were Singles,

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:54.530
and once we became Primas, people started calling us the "Three Great Water Fairies".

00:09:55.190 --> 00:10:01.090
But it got harder for the three of us to get together.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:10.000
It's made me realize how important it is to me when we <i>do</i> get together.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:14.370
Not that I want to go back to those times, but you know...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:21.010
I just really wanted us three to meet up today.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.770
Oh, look at me.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.630
What am I, a little girl?

00:10:45.530 --> 00:10:46.890
Alicia...

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:22.990
Athena...

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:39.090
Ladies and gentlemen of the Association,
my name is Akira E. Ferrari, from Himeya.

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:42.570
I ask that you please forgive this moment of insolence.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:45.720
Take this, Alicia!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:06.830
Akira...

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:23.340
Happy birthday, Alicia!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:40.570
Thanks, Akari. This was all thanks to you.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.790
No, no.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:47.440
This was a miracle. It's incredible, Akira!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.090
Come on, you're exaggerating.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:55.920
M-Maybe...

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.630
But maybe it really was a miracle!

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:09.290
When Akira laughed like that,
and when we saw Alicia and Athena,

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:14.280
the three of them were smiling like they were little girls.

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:21.770
That's wonderful.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.530
Yeah.

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.990
I hope one day...

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:31.490
I can meet someone special for me,
like how Akira and Athena are for Alicia,

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:35.710
or how Aika and Alice are for you.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.430
I'm sure you will.

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:45.930
Aqua is overflowing with miracles.

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:48.870
Right!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:14:00.110
Meeting someone you want to meet or hearing from someone you want to hear from may not seem terribly special,

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:06.810
but even the most mundane things in life just might actually be wondrous miracles.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.480
Just like how I can spend this time with Ai.

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:23.470
I make a wish

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:34.440
To the clouds vanishing beyond the calm blue

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:38.780
Hoping for a new day to dawn on us

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:47.260
Now, let's be on our way

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:52.810
It's time for our journey to begin

00:14:53.960 --> 00:15:05.340
Let's set sail together

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:13.840
And little by little, head toward our goal

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:24.280
I realized that you always watched over me

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:34.290
Though you might not be by my side anymore

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:48.220
You taught me what happiness means

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:54.990
I will never forget that

00:15:54.990 --> 00:16:07.530
And these feelings will shine eternal
